Simple AI Usage Indicator

This is Ivo Lopes's personal project, derived from Codex Usage Indicator
by stone (GitHub: stonega):
https://github.com/stonega/codex-usage-indicator

The shared ancestor is f2bd496acb648bbf343e3ea7a4a1a54f6c0bbb55 (version 14,
2026-09-04). Inherited work includes the original panel/preferences implementation,
Codex authentication and usage adapter, limit-reset detection, reset-credit expiry,
GSettings definitions and their tests. Git history retains the original authorship.

Ivo Lopes's subsequent fork changes include the multi-provider adapters for Codex,
Claude Code and Antigravity, provider orchestration, scrolling popup, Portuguese
translations, icon-style options, fork metadata and packaging. The urgent fixes
of 2026-10-05 add structured Antigravity quota handling, regression coverage and
replace provider logos with original generic geometric icons (see ASSETS.md).
The fork is not affiliated with or endorsed by the provider companies. Mindsite's
Plane workspace is used only for backlog tracking; this is not a Mindsite product.

Selective upstream compatibility fixes reviewed in the second wave:
- Denny Huang's St.BoxLayout orientation approach (2fc4bcb, GNOME Shell 51).
- Andreas Weiden's inherited title-color correction (601e5a4, Shell themes).
The fork adapts these approaches to its multi-provider menu; no wholesale merge
or upstream metadata/version overwrite was performed.

